blood all over your ugly mug!

255
00:15:58,760 --> 00:16:00,280
I can't get it off!

256
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:05,935
Hey, it's the metal pole from earlier!

257
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:08,472
Mista, your bullet must have reshaped it!

258
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:12,380
Shit, that hurts!

259
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:13,976
What's this feeling?

260
00:16:14,180 --> 00:16:17,160
Something warm and wet is
trickling down my back!

261
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:20,800
A moment ago, you asked
if I had determinazione.

262
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:26,900
Well, I'm gonna show you what it's all
about, but you gotta do the same for me!

263
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:29,977
Let me see just how determined you are to

264
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:32,707
be shot into the proverbial
hell frozen over!

265
00:16:33,980 --> 00:16:35,686
This bastard's still upright.

266
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:38,697
What's worse, he's trying
to shove me back even more!

267
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:41,240
This lunatic is gonna kill me!

268
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:44,260
Merida, I gotta hurry
and yank this thing out!

269
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:50,220
Stop it!

270
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,557
The bullet'll come back!

271
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:53,464
You won't survive another blow!

272
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:54,840
I had no choice.

273
00:16:55,160 --> 00:16:57,336
That's what it means to have resolve.

274
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:59,991
Now buckle up, bullets, and hold on tight!

275
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,057
It's not over till it's over!

276
00:17:07,140 --> 00:17:08,740
White ice, gently weeps!

277
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,660
It's too much, Mista!

278
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,440
You're gonna pass out!

279
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,687
Think about what that means.

280
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,120
We'll fade away.

281
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:26,400
No, not yet.

282
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,937
I've still got some
fight left in this body.

283
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:30,726
I can still pull the trigger.

284
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,860
That's the way you got him good!

285
00:17:39,660 --> 00:17:41,520
You're wrong, you fools.

286
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:47,560
Fine, you may have Determinazione,
but I've got even more.

287
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,420
Guido Mista.

288
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:54,280
I have to say, you dole
out some major damage.

289
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:56,080
Kudos to you, amigo.

290
00:17:57,220 --> 00:18:01,220
However, losing all that blood
was actually to my advantage.

291
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:05,840
I froze the blood you forced out of
me and created my own icy support.

292
00:18:06,080 --> 00:18:10,317
It keeps that pesky spike from sinking
further into my neck, so I'm good to go!

293
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:13,106
You won't beat me that
easily, you understand?

294
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,580
Oh, by the way, did you forget?

295
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:18,200
You still have a final bullet in play.

296
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:22,760
That's now in your skull! I win!

297
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:25,150
Huh?

298
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,360
