Your determination.

302
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:41,980
It shines even brighter
than the morning sun.

303
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:44,164
It's showed us the way forward.

304
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:47,220
And it's put us on the
path toward tomorrow.

305
00:18:47,860 --> 00:18:49,577
We've won because of you.

306
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:53,000
WHAT THE HELL?!

307
00:19:11,060 --> 00:19:15,740
I'm finally starting to realize
something about this Giorno Giovanna.

308
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:17,597
He's a total rookie.

309
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:24,140
But even so, when he says something will
happen, it eventually comes to fruition.

310
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:28,440
My Determinazione was really Giorno's.

311
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:32,100
It flooded my being without
me even realizing it.

312
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:35,900
It's like he superseded
Bucciarati to become Capo,

313
00:19:36,100 --> 00:19:38,100
