314
00:19:38,560 --> 00:19:40,440
How the hell does he do that?

315
00:19:40,940 --> 00:19:42,352
Guess it doesn't matter.

316
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:45,180
Not like obsessing over
it won't do any good.

317
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:49,700
Hey, Mista.

318
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:52,200
We did it, huh? We got the disc.

319
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:53,800
All thanks to you.

320
